{"type":"text","timestamp":1793965311941,"sessionID":"ses_e4f564ccaffe7SsC3T4QG44vf5","part":{"id":"prt_1b0aa0fda0017PsLahsGREkddM","sessionID":"ses_e4f564ccaffe7SsC3T4QG44vf5","messageID":"msg_1b0aa08c3001Jsb6ofP2o0rFxm","type":"text","text":"To explore the public C# repo and load it using the Roslyn MCP tools, we can follow these steps:\n\n1. **Load the Solution**: Use the `tools.roslyn.get_public_api_surface()` tool to load the public API surface of the solution.\n2. **Check Background Task Status**: Use the `tools.roslyn.get_task_status()` tool to check the status of the background task.\n3. **Report Success or Failure**: Depending on the status, report whether the real MCP tool call succeeded or not.\n\nHere is the plan in JSON format:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"load_solution\",\n      \"tool\": \"tools.roslyn.get_public_api_surface()\",\n      \"description\": \"Load the public API surface of the solution.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"check_task_status\",\n      \"tool\": \"tools.roslyn.get_task_status({\\\"taskId\\\": \\\"load_solution\\\"})\",\n      \"description\": \"Check the status of the background task.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"report_status\",\n      \"tool\": \"tools.execute(`if (response.status === 'succeeded') { console.log('Real MCP tool call succeeded.'); } else { console.log('Real MCP tool call failed.'); }`)\",\n      \"description\": \"Report the success or failure of the real MCP tool call.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nTo execute this plan, you need to switch to the `general` subagent.","time":{"start":1793965297626,"end":1793965311941}}}
